 Mission Level, meet the main objectives and a portal will appear (currently only one type of main objective);
 Mini-Boss Level;
 Boss Level;
 Camp Level, recover HP, Shield and Oxygen.
 Beating a Mission, Mini-Boss and Boss Level will drop a chest as well as a Portal to next level;
 Sometimes, completing a level might offer more than one portal to different levels;
 To complete the map, you will have to choose a path to the Boss Level;
 To beat the game, you will have to clear the whole 3 maps.
Chips
 Acid Spillage；
 Acid Flow；
 Acid Affinity.
Weapons - Acid Spitter special attack.
Radioactive Dust - Is now an Oxygen system. Oxygen bar will decrease over time (across levels) and whenever depleted, you'll start losing life up to achieving an Oxygen refill at a Camp level.
Settings - Mouse XY inversion options.



